[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0088","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0040","title":"glFtpD SITE ZIPCHK 命令本地权限提升漏洞","description":"glFTPD 存在本地权限提升漏洞，本地攻击者通过在 SITE ZIPCHK 命令中插入元字符（metacharacters）可执行任意系统命令，从而获取更高权限。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的命令参数进行充分过滤或转义，攻击者需拥有本地账户即可利用，成功利用后可提升至 root 权限，完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0040"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:52.640","remediation":"立即升级 glFTPd 至 1.24 或更高版本，该版本已修复 SITE ZIPCHK 命令中元字符未正确转义的问题。如无法升级，在 glftpd.conf 中禁用 SITE ZIPCHK 命令（添加 deny SITE ZIPCHK 规则），并确保 FTP 用户使用 chroot 限制目录访问权限，降低提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0040","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0040.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0040.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0040","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/cf818d3668155ee14907188346fea9ac5f2014db/2000/CVE-2000-0040.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0040/README.md","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1921.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0040.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w4rv-5mh3-w9fg/GHSA-w4rv-5mh3-w9fg.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0040.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/ftp.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0077","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0038","title":"glFTPd 1.17.2 默认后门账户远程代码执行漏洞","description":"glFTPd 1.17.2 版本存在默认后门账号漏洞。该 FTP 服务器软件在安装时内置了一个名为 glftpd 的默认用户账号，其密码为固定值且用户 UID 被设置为 0（即 root 权限）。攻击者无需任何身份认证，即可通过网络远程连接到目标服务器的 FTP 端口，使用该默认账号密码登录系统，从而获得服务器的 root 级别完全控制权限，可执行任意代码、读取或篡改敏感文件。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0038"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:52.390","remediation":"立即升级 glFTPd 至 2.0 及以上版本（最新为 v2.16），旧版 1.17.2 内置了 UID 为 0 的默认管理员账户 glftpd 及已知默认密码。如无法升级，手动删除或禁用 glftpd 用户账号，修改 /etc/glftpd/ftpusers 中所有默认账户的密码，并检查是否存在其他 UID 0 的非授权账号。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0038","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19690","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0038.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0038.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0038","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/cf818d3668155ee14907188346fea9ac5f2014db/2000/CVE-2000-0038.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0038.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0038.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88216/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/cee5a3b524678beb8613152453ffdb7e3eac41b4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0026","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0028","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 跨帧安全策略绕过漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.0、5.0 及 5.01 版本中的 external.NavigateAndFind 函数存在跨帧安全策略绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可构造恶意网页，诱导用户访问后绕过同源策略限制，跨帧读取目标系统上的本地文件。该漏洞利用条件简单，仅需用户使用受影响浏览器访问攻击者控制的页面即可触发。由于当时 IE 浏览器市场占有率极高，该漏洞影响范围广泛。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0028"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:51.210","remediation":"升级到 Internet Explorer 6.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 IE 6.0 及后续版本中修复。由于 IE 5.x 系列已停止技术支持且不再获得安全更新，强烈建议升级到 Microsoft Edge 或现代第三方浏览器（如 Chrome/Firefox）。如因系统限制无法升级浏览器，可禁用 Active Scripting 并在 Internet 安全区域设置为高作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0028","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19686","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0028.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0028.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0028","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/cf818d3668155ee14907188346fea9ac5f2014db/2000/CVE-2000-0028.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0028.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0028.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000962.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0026.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0026.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0003","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0001","title":"RealNetworks RealServer 5.0 ramgen 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealServer 5.0 的 ramgen 组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向目标服务器发送特制的超长 ramgen 请求，导致 RealServer 服务崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 RealNetworks RealServer 5.0 版本，攻击条件简单，仅需向目标 80/8080 端口发送恶意构造的 HTTP 请求即可触发，无需任何权限。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0001"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:47.890","remediation":"建议升级至 RealNetworks RealServer 5.0.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ramgen 组件对超长请求的缓冲区处理。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层限制请求 URI 长度不超过 1024 字节，并过滤对 /ramgen 路径的异常请求以缓解 DoS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/888","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19687","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2000/CVE-2000-0001.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0001.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0001","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d2150d97be85a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0001.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0001.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4cp2-rrgq-4f3c/GHSA-4cp2-rrgq-4f3c.json","https://github.com/cve-search/CveXplore/blob/240054a679701805ccad71dd505dd6b6310a518c/CveXplore/database/helpers/specific_db.py","https://github.com/elastic/integrations/blob/53384e04c2ffd85b66b53441c8287193fc936e05/packages/xm_cyber/_dev/deploy/docker/files/config.yml","https://github.com/CySCA/CySCA2014/blob/13581fced84f250667c6407cdabb3290572b5b47/challenges.md","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/ramcrash.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0003.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0003.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0104","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0119","title":"McAfee VirusScan 与 Norton AntiVirus 回收站文件扫描绕过漏洞","description":"McAfee Virus Scan 及 Norton Anti-Virus 等杀毒软件的默认配置未将 Windows 回收站目录（RECYCLED 文件夹）纳入病毒扫描范围，攻击者可利用此安全遗漏将恶意代码放置在回收站文件中，绕过杀毒软件的实时监控与文件检测机制。该漏洞影响 McAfee 4.0、Network Associates for Windows NT 4.0.2/4.0.3 及 Norton AntiVirus 2000 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。由于回收站文件在系统默认行为下不被自动扫描，攻击者无需特殊权限即可实现恶意代码的持久驻留与隐蔽执行。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0119"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-22T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:02.397","remediation":"将 McAfee VirusScan 升级至 4.0.4 以上版本，或 Norton AntiVirus 升级至 2001 以上版本；在现有版本中手动开启「扫描回收站文件夹」选项，在实时扫描配置中添加 C:\\RECYCLED 目录为扫描路径，确保所有文件操作均经过病毒检测引擎。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94936267131123&w=2","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19733","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0119.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2d894f23944bb9acf861e3c6e192d8f723b95560/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0119.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0119","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0119.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0119.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/37358611606378c1ef62b2ed4e6b7dfbe11dca04/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8ffx-cmw4-hwwr/GHSA-8ffx-cmw4-hwwr.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0119.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/956/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0104.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0066","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0032","title":"Sun Solaris 7.0 DMI 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 7.0 的 DMI（桌面管理接口）组件中存在拒绝服务漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 /var/dmi/db 数据库目录写入特制的恶意文件，导致 dmispd 守护进程在处理该文件时崩溃，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Solaris 7.0 操作系统，利用门槛低，本地用户即可触发，无需任何特权认证。攻击者可以利用此漏洞中断系统的桌面管理服务，影响系统管理功能的正常运行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0032"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-22T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:51.683","remediation":"升级到不受影响的 Solaris 版本（如 Solaris 8 及以上），或安装 Sun 官方补丁 106872-01（SPARC）/ 106873-01（x86）。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户对 /var/dmi/db 目录的写入权限，或禁用 dmispd 服务：在 /etc/init.d 中停止 dmi 并移除相应启动链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7582","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/878","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19681","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0032.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0032","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0032/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0032.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0032.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9ab7f615fa197c3d4aa5deb3277be237fd967af8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4qj3-rmh9-cc9v/GHSA-4qj3-rmh9-cc9v.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d1825faa-5f7d-45f8-b00d-8c89cfa8e56a.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0066.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0066.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0066.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0031","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0034","title":"Netscape Communicator 密码明文存储漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.7 客户端存在密码存储安全漏洞。当用户通过 IMAP 或 POP 协议进行邮件会话时，即使未启用\"记住密码\"功能，程序仍会将用户邮箱密码以明文形式记录在 preferences.js 配置文件中。本地攻击者可通过读取该配置文件获取用户邮箱登录凭据，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Netscape Communicator 4.7 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0034"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-22T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:51.913","remediation":"升级到 Netscape 4.73 及以上版本，或改用受支持的现代浏览器（如 Firefox）。如需继续使用 Netscape，每次结束 IMAP/POP 会话后手动删除 profiles 目录下的 preferences.js 文件中保存的密码行，并取消勾选「Remember Password」选项。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0034","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0034.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0034","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/cf818d3668155ee14907188346fea9ac5f2014db/2000/CVE-2000-0034.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0034.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/923ff6a65023a656eae3176c80264be899b097da/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-237w-fwrp-rqvw/GHSA-237w-fwrp-rqvw.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0034.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88221/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0016","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0018","title":"FreeBSD wmmon 配置文件本地权限提升漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统中的 Window Maker 窗口管理器组件 wmmon 存在命令执行漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在被攻击用户的 Home 目录下构造恶意的 .wmmonrc 配置文件，当 wmmon 程序加载该配置文件时会执行其中包含的任意命令，从而导致攻击者以目标用户权限执行恶意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Windowmaker wmmon 1.0 b2 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0018"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-22T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:50.007","remediation":"移除 wmmon 二进制文件的 setuid 权限位（`chmod u-s /usr/X11R6/bin/wmmon`），阻止本地用户通过劫持 `~/.wmmonrc` 配置文件实现提权；如无需使用，直接通过 `pkg_delete wmmon` 或 `pkg remove wmmon` 卸载该软件包以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1169","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/885","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19685","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ed3e8dec058a54f5d840cd78ee86185dee6350a7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0018.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0018","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0018.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0d27f094f5d35fbe4c8dfb1d77d8b1a736d9a17a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0018.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/76afc904d2c3de5054b6306275bb2a85f23de0a1/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rq6w-v5p8-7365/GHSA-rq6w-v5p8-7365.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0018.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153900_154000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f95ed58f-e12f-4d60-b42f-eb76b7f6d21f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/223a52603d6d6e3aeedaf68a49b4971f3a3db26a/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0016.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0004","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0002","title":"ZBServer Pro 1.5 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ZBServer Pro 1.5 存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标 Web 服务发送超长 GET 请求，触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖返回地址并劫持程序执行流，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 ZBServer Pro 1.5 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议用户升级至最新版本或部署入侵检测规则拦截超长请求。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0002"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-22T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:47.997","remediation":"ZBServer Pro 1.5 的 GET 请求处理函数存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者发送超长 GET 请求即可远程执行任意代码。厂商 ZBSoft 未对此漏洞发布任何官方补丁，且该产品已停止维护。**推荐方案**：停止使用 ZBServer Pro，迁移至 Apache HTTP Server、Nginx 或 IIS 等仍在安全维护的 Web 服务器。**临时缓解措施**：在边界防火墙上限制仅允许受信任 IP 访问服务器 TCP 80（HTTP）和 21（FTP）端口；同时在前置反向代理层实施请求行长度限制（如 nginx 的 large_client_header_buffers 配置），过滤超长 GET 请求以阻止利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94598388530358&w=2","http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind9912&L=NTBUGTRAQ&P=R3556","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/889","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=36B0596E.8D111D66%40teleline.es","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19689","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2000/CVE-2000-0002.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0002.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0002","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0002/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1baa87c09640becdfd7ca993d7d2150d97be85a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0002.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0002.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-93jv-frh5-3962/GHSA-93jv-frh5-3962.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/www_server_name.nasl","https://github.com/LubyRuffy/plugins/blob/f873b19f27c95eaf2993ca4acde5cb7965d2ee3f/2009/www_too_long_url.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0004.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0004.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0034","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0036","title":"Microsoft Outlook Express 5 for Macintosh HTML 邮件附件自动下载漏洞","description":"Outlook Express 5 for Macintosh 在处理 HTML 格式邮件时存在安全缺陷，程序会自动下载邮件中嵌入的附件而不会向用户弹出安全提示或征求确认，导致用户可能在不知情的情况下将恶意文件下载到本地系统。攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的 HTML 邮件，利用该漏洞在不经用户同意的情况下植入任意文件，进一步结合其他漏洞可实现对目标系统的控制。该漏洞影响 Outlook Express 5 for Macintosh 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，需用户升级至更高版本或使用其他邮件客户端进行防范。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0036"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-22","updated":"2026-07-21","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-060（KB249082）提供的官方补丁，该补丁修复了 Outlook Express 5 for Macintosh 在接收 HTML 邮件时自动下载附件而不提示用户的安全缺陷。由于该产品已停止技术支持，建议迁移至受支持的邮件客户端或升级到更高版本的操作系统附带的邮件程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ249082","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-060","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0036.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0036.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0036","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0036.json","https://github.com/xaitax/SploitScan/blob/938d5f69569a096cf728175efd0ca15f6fd92c6a/README.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0036.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wh2w-hjg4-rm27/GHSA-wh2w-hjg4-rm27.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0036.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a764f258-6b82-4c04-ba90-c93bde670c0a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0034.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0028","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0030","title":"Sun Solaris DMI 服务 dmispd 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 操作系统中 Desktop Management Interface（DMI）服务的 dmispd 守护进程存在拒绝服务漏洞。dmi_cmd 组件未对 /var/dmi/db 数据库目录的文件创建操作进行充分限制，本地攻击者可通过持续向该目录写入大量文件来耗尽磁盘空间，导致系统因磁盘满载而拒绝服务。该漏洞仅需本地用户权限即可触发，CVSS v2 评分为 5.0（中危），影响 Solaris 7（SunOS 5.7）版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0030"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-12-22","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Solaris 至已修复版本，或安装 Sun 官方安全补丁（Solaris 7 SPARC 补丁 106954 系列，x86 补丁 106955 系列）。若暂时无法打补丁，可通过将 /var/dmi/db 目录权限设置为 700、限制仅 dmispd 服务账户可写，并对该目录所在分区配置磁盘配额以防止空间耗尽。同时建议禁用不需要的 DMI 服务以减小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/878","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-0030"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0028.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0055","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0026","title":"SCO Unixware 7.1 i2odialogd 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SCO Unixware 7.1 的 i2odialogd 守护进程存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向该服务发送超长的用户名/密码认证字符串触发缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者以 root 权限在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 SCO Unixware 7.1 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需任何认证即可远程利用，且利用代码已公开，现实威胁极高。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0026"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-21T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:50.967","remediation":"立即停用 i2odialogd 守护进程并移除可执行权限：`chmod -x /usr/sbin/i2odialogd && killall i2odialogd`。在网关/防火墙上封锁该服务所监听的 TCP 端口（默认 447），阻止外部访问。由于 SCO Unixware 7.1 已终止支持且不再发布安全补丁，建议将业务迁移至受支持的现代操作系统（如 Oracle Solaris 11.4 或 Linux），或将服务隔离在无外网权限的独立安全区域中运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94606167110764&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/6310","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/876","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19680","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0026.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0026","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0026/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0026.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0026.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8b80e198eccaa13040dbe03d79f3c9c06085d067/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h3gh-fgjq-2grf/GHSA-h3gh-fgjq-2grf.json","https://github.com/scipag/AttackToolKit/blob/78bf88564956b8f18a37659dc3d345093e95a136/plugins/SCO%20i2odialogd%20buffer%20overflow.plugin","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/i2odialogd.nasl","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/58483feae33b0cf267fbaf995b37b047d774ba78/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-00xx/CVE-2000-0026.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0044","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0044.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0017","title":"Linux Linuxconf 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linuxconf 1.1.6 r10 存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过向目标系统提交超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行并以 root 权限完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害等级严重，CVSS 评分 10.0。建议用户立即升级至高版本或应用补丁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0017"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-21T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:49.870","remediation":"立即升级 Linuxconf 至 1.1.7 及以上版本，或卸载 linuxconf 软件包（该项目已停止维护），改用 Webmin/Cockpit 等现代管理工具替代。如无法升级，在防火墙层面限制对端口 98/tcp 的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94580196627059&w=2","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20619","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ed3e8dec058a54f5d840cd78ee86185dee6350a7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0017.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0017","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0017/README.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/7ddd42377be9a6b7218518cc45c52da044b527c3/2000/CVE-2000-0017.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0017.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wqfg-p47g-c3m7/GHSA-wqfg-p47g-c3m7.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/linuxconf_detect.nasl","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0d27f094f5d35fbe4c8dfb1d77d8b1a736d9a17a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0017.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2352/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0044.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0044.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0024","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0025","title":"Microsoft IIS 和 Site Server 虚拟目录命名漏洞","description":"IIS 4.0 及 Site Server 3.0 存在虚拟目录命名漏洞。当虚拟目录名称包含 .com、.exe、.sh、.cgi、.dll 等扩展名时，远程攻击者可绕过 ASP 脚本执行机制，通过直接请求获取 ASP 文件的源代码，从而泄露数据库连接字符串、管理员密码等敏感信息。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响广泛部署的 IIS Web 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0025"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-21T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:50.833","remediation":"升级到 IIS 5.0 或更高版本（如 Windows 2000 及以上系统自带的 IIS），该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，避免在虚拟目录名称中使用 .com、.exe、.sh、.cgi、.dll 等扩展名字符串，并限制对 ASP 文件的直接访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ238606","http://www.osvdb.org/8098","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-058","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0025.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0025","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0025.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0025.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/76afc904d2c3de5054b6306275bb2a85f23de0a1/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-34rm-j4gj-85h8/GHSA-34rm-j4gj-85h8.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0025.yaml","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0025.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154000_154100.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0024.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0024.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0023","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0024","title":"Microsoft Internet Information Server URL解析安全绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 在处理 URL 规范化时存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 URL 中插入特殊转义字符（如 `%` 编码序列）绕过第三方软件和 IIS 自身的访问控制限制，非法访问受限资源。该漏洞影响 IIS 4.0 及早期版本，攻击者无需认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中等。Microsoft 已发布安全公告并建议用户安装相应补丁进行修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0024"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-21T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:50.710","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-023 提供的补丁，升级 IIS 至最新版本。在 IIS 管理器中禁用 URL 中的转义字符解析功能，并在 Web 服务器上配置 URLScan 工具拦截恶意 URL 请求。同时限制第三方软件对 IIS 的访问权限，实施最小权限原则。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ246401","http://www.acrossecurity.com/aspr/ASPR-1999-11-10-1-PUB.txt","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-061","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0024.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0024","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0024.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed0